	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Romy achète ${{n}}$ pains aux raisins à ${{eval:floor((p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(p,10)}}~\\unit{€}$ l'un et ${{m}}$ chaussons aux pommes. Elle donne un billet de $20~\\unit{€}$ au boulanger, qui lui rend ${{eval:floor((2000-n*p-m*u)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(2000-n*p-m*u,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(2000-n*p-m*u,10)}}~\\unit{€}$.\n\nQuel est le prix d'un chausson aux pommes ?\n\nUn chausson coûte $?~\\text{€}$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "2..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "3..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "pE",
					"expression": "1..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "pC",
					"expression": "1..99"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "eval:100*pE+pC"
				},
				{
					"name": "uE",
					"expression": "1..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "uC",
					"expression": "1..99"
				},
				{
					"name": "u",
					"expression": "eval:100*uE+uC"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["2000 - n * p - m * u >= 100", "p != u"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(u)/100;d}}",
					"requiredForm": {
						"pattern": "a:number"
					}
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**Ce que Romy a dépensé.** $20 - {{eval:floor((2000-n*p-m*u)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(2000-n*p-m*u,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(2000-n*p-m*u,10)}} = {{eval:floor((n*p+m*u)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p+m*u,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p+m*u,10)}}$.",
					"**Les pains.** ${{n}} \\times {{eval:floor((p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(p,10)}} = {{eval:floor((n*p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p,10)}}$.",
					"**Les chaussons ensemble.** ${{eval:floor((n*p+m*u)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p+m*u,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p+m*u,10)}} - {{eval:floor((n*p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p,10)}} = {{eval:floor((m*u)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(m*u,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(m*u,10)}}$.\n\n```schema-barres\nChaussons : ? ; ?{{if:m>2| ; ?|}}{{if:m>3| ; ?|}}{{if:m>4| ; ?|}}{{if:m>5| ; ?|}}{{if:m>6| ; ?|}}{{if:m>7| ; ?|}} = {{eval:floor((m*u)/100)}},{{eval:floor(mod((m*u),100)/10)}}{{eval:mod((m*u),10)}} €\n```",
					"**Un chausson.** Les ${{m}}$ chaussons coûtent tous le même prix : ${{eval:floor((m*u)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(m*u,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(m*u,10)}} \\div {{m}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:floor((u)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(u,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(u,10)}}}$.",
					"Un chausson aux pommes coûte ${{eval:floor((u)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(u,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(u,10)}}~\\unit{€}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "${{m}}$ amis achètent ensemble ${{k}}$ boîtes de jeux à ${{eval:floor((m*t)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(m*t,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(m*t,10)}}~\\unit{€}$ la boîte. Ils partagent la dépense en parts égales.\n\nCombien chaque ami paie-t-il ?\n\nChacun paie $?~\\text{€}$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "3..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "2..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "70..450"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["mod(t,5) == 0", "k != m"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(k*t)/100;d}}",
					"requiredForm": {
						"pattern": "a:number"
					}
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**La dépense totale.** ${{k}} \\times {{eval:floor((m*t)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(m*t,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(m*t,10)}} = {{eval:floor((k*m*t)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(k*m*t,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(k*m*t,10)}}$.",
					"**Le partage.** On partage en ${{m}}$ parts égales : ${{eval:floor((k*m*t)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(k*m*t,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(k*m*t,10)}} \\div {{m}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:floor((k*t)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(k*t,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(k*t,10)}}}$.",
					"Chaque ami paie ${{eval:floor((k*t)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(k*t,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(k*t,10)}}~\\unit{€}$.",
					"On vérifie : ${{m}} \\times {{eval:floor((k*t)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(k*t,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(k*t,10)}} = {{eval:floor((k*m*t)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(k*m*t,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(k*m*t,10)}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Pour financer une sortie, la classe vend ${{n}}$ gâteaux à ${{eval:floor((p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(p,10)}}~\\unit{€}$ le gâteau. Les ingrédients ont coûté ${{eval:F}}~\\unit{€}$.\n\nCombien d'argent reste-t-il pour la sortie ?\n\nIl reste $?~\\text{€}$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "40..360"
				},
				{
					"name": "F",
					"expression": "35..480"
				},
				{
					"name": "pE",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "pC",
					"expression": "1..99"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "eval:100*pE+pC"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["n * p - 100 * F >= 2000", "mod(p,10) != 0", "mod(n,10) != 0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(n*p-100*F)/100;d}}",
					"requiredForm": {
						"pattern": "a:number"
					}
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**La recette.** ${{n}} \\times {{eval:floor((p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(p,10)}} = {{eval:floor((n*p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p,10)}}$.",
					"**On retire les frais.** ${{eval:floor((n*p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p,10)}} - {{F}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:floor((n*p-100*F)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p-100*F,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p-100*F,10)}}}$.",
					"Il reste ${{eval:floor((n*p-100*F)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p-100*F,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p-100*F,10)}}~\\unit{€}$ pour la sortie.",
					"On vérifie : ${{eval:floor((n*p-100*F)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p-100*F,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p-100*F,10)}} + {{F}} = {{eval:floor((n*p)/100)}}.{{eval:floor(mod(n*p,100)/10)}}{{eval:mod(n*p,10)}}$ ; on retrouve la recette."
				]
			}
		}
	],
